    },
    {
      "text": "Comparisons of the standard SMC method with 1 million particles with four PIMH samplers with",
      "bbox": [
        85.66973876953125,
        584.277099609375,
        443.6116027832031,
        592.01806640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "different combinations of N and L (N D25 and LD40000 (PIMH1), N D100 and LD10000 (PIMH2), N D250",
      "bbox": [
        48.08970260620117,
        592.5570068359375,
        443.7855529785156,
        600.9841918945312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and L D 4000 (PIMH3), and N D 1000 and L D 1000 (PIMH4)) of (a) average RMSE for all ﬁve (\u0005, SMC;",
      "bbox": [
        48.091339111328125,
        601.5231323242188,
        444.2667236328125,
